WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.600
The minister who created Caminho da Escola, bringing buses, bicycles and boats so poor students across Brazil could get to school,

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.600
will be the mayor who lets you

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:20.000
ride public transit for a whole month, with no limits, going wherever you want.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The monthly transit pass will be the greatest benefit ever given to São Paulo's transit riders.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Think new. Vote Haddad.
